{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/c/efc44fe3c2eee1e7ecc3ed823b5680c41990f7ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[\\log_{10}(5\\log_{10}100)]^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/a/45afd4e83e388d03cf19e53cca8628e045ebfb54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\log_{10}50 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 25\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 10 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 2\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"419\" height=\"17\" />  \n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/c/efc44fe3c2eee1e7ecc3ed823b5680c41990f7ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[\\log_{10}(5\\log_{10}100)]^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/8/3189e160441b7cfb516911441df5005a33298c09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^2 = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/f/f1f80d2bd83b5b8c24ffe76228a6189f92a10797.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10} 100 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"17\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/3/263737c04de4ec0727ae80eeb01af25cd534aed2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[\\log_{10}(5\\cdot 2)]^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"99\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Multiply:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/d/96dba284f4e8b8fcc998ca639fbf55cac335fd6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[\\log_{10}(10)]^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"85\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c5570ef9db4a954810b7e5e07879edb7f57541b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^1 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/c/1dcf1fbe904b419932da0c65ae952feeff8301d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10} 10 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"17\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/a/70a12e382869188a7b637d553bc34cbc2d626334.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[1]^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"28\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/e/62effaf0d5dc9bfa1d137bed40c4baa73698962d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspa